{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c39ac2912eb8208d136d4046e1e133249dd3b35122f916887240f70817b6b0fe","ja":"アイスクリームパーティー開催！","zh":"冰淇淋派对开幕！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"14f9c862eb185c40aa5221a8e6004cf0779b77a0e698defc1ce4a565584fa973","ja":"それでは……只今から\nアイスクリームパーティーを開催します！","zh":"那么……现在开始\n举办冰淇淋派对！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"42249e557821ca1395c14ad238d800996f4ed6f5e2fe030dc507d11ffbcc32d7","ja":"わー！　パチパチパチ～！","zh":"哇——！啪啪啪——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bc730ffaba19643faf95151c4cc2551bd4a1bf71b27e008b33e71176916157bf","ja":"それじゃあ、エレナのアイス屋さん、開店だヨー！\nコトハの注文は全部盛りだよネ！　メグミは？","zh":"那么，艾莲娜的冰淇淋店，开门营业喽——！\n琴叶点的是全套大满贯对吧！惠呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"987f38d4d05ffe6ace7c9463f3bf5c0e2e00b51e77a2156d7db77048b8a7cb90","ja":"アタシは、最初はバニラにしようかな。","zh":"我一开始先选香草味好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"258e5dee11bd02b7583725e51f0d6fe9a0cee35b1d7d6874d41ba726fe651c07","ja":"ハーイ！　カナとミナコはどのフレーバーにする？\nどんなリクエストでも、バッチリ応えちゃうヨ～♪","zh":"嗨——！可奈和美奈子想要什么口味？\n不论什么样的要求，我都能完美满足哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"823a7a21b6aabbece88a40bf13f249250c560e4323766a999e5ca6c1608e62b2","ja":"わぁ～♪　アイスもトッピングも\nいろんな種類がありますね。迷っちゃうな～♪","zh":"哇～♪　冰淇淋和配料\n都有好多种类呢。真让人难以抉择呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f581dffdca4b3b25a2de77de804dab5e3bc82da336b03855f893149757247d92","ja":"それなら最初は、琴葉ちゃんみたいに\n全部盛りにしてみたらどうかな？","zh":"要是那样的话，一开始像琴叶那样\n全部加满试试看怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"26a4c175405266886cb0d33ae01c3f2b068a10ee3c007508457b6ce80c1e8c2e","ja":"私は、いろんな組み合わせを\n試してみたいから、自分で掬うね♪","zh":"我想尝试各种各样的搭配，\n就自己来舀吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"548e826f5de354ed461cf8761bbe87c4d1c8ac1957e43489786a12f8f5062428","ja":"コトハとカナの全部盛り完成だヨ～！\nワタシもメグミと一緒でバニラから……ヨシ♪","zh":"琴叶和可奈的豪华全套完成了哟～！\n我也和惠美一样从香草开始……好嘞♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"ef8826c1bda79fe6e16f5ba90967c4c5422711de3505791805f1d70fd8478ba2","ja":"みんなの所に行き渡ったみたいだね。\nそれじゃあ、みんな一緒に……いただきまーす！","zh":"大家都拿到了呢。\n那么，大家一起……我开动啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"8ed6f9f9765b904df14b0bd9766c2e4bb8e549e51ce897b7bb16f6cf13d2e4a4","ja":"……う～ん、濃厚で美味しい～♪","zh":"……嗯～，浓郁又美味～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"40df551bd09b4310b7b60f576766dc994bc049fa315bd44abfc7a83d8a902c10","ja":"アタシはここに、銀色のツブツブをのっけて……。\nこれ、なんていうんだっけ？","zh":"我要在这里放上银色的小颗粒……\n这个叫什么来着？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"c260072fd0f67969ef2414092741e28b2ac5b3bf9f6a3884621953770bef9a44","ja":"アラザン。原料はお砂糖だよ。\nあっ、恵美の盛り付け、なんだか真珠星っぽいね。","zh":"银珠糖。原料是白糖哦。\n啊，惠美的摆盘，感觉有点像珍珠星呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"e8ae516540a5532a04abcec7d8cdd9fae54f78bfd8921591d56c6dc2322271da","ja":"え？　……あっ、言われてみればそうかも？","zh":"诶？……啊，经你这么一说好像确实是这样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"678f7239322800e035343db0ed67b367f1b20cda98e6d5f2f2453d5498a8c8c9","ja":"なんか、小さい真珠っぽいし！","zh":"感觉就像小颗珍珠一样嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"4c27a45fdb05d5c38f0db86eda4cf65213ab7a1033958ed96bb2a2e991ef7099","ja":"それもあるけど、バニラの白に、キラキラが\n加わって、ステージで輝く真珠星っぽいなって。","zh":"这也算一方面，但加上香草的白色与闪闪发光的感觉，\n就觉得很像在舞台上绽放光芒的角宿一呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1452.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8152e3f92c37b8acca8e054ae3784ae456ecc38eef934fba8003890d88b6a39e","ja":"藍は……アイスで例えると、チョコミントかナ？\n甘いけど、キリっとしてるからネ♪","zh":"蓝嘛……用冰淇淋来打比方的话，就是薄荷巧克力吧？\n虽然甜，但又很清爽呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
